      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm seeing a CrashLoopBackOff on one of our microservices in GKE. i checked the logs but it's pretty vague. can u give me a checklist of what to look for to see if its a resource issue, a liveness probe failing, or just a bad config?",
