      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait what did u mean by \"goblin in the machine\"? anyway, thanks for the list. i checked the resource usage and it looks okay, hovering around 40% cpu usage. i'm leaning towards it being the probe. can u give me more specific commands or things to check in kubectl to see if the liveness probe is actually what's killing the pod?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
